        "original_id": "20fbe2f2-11e4-5249-aeff-27b4902773ad",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mike Williams, Sylvester Stallone, Talia Shire, Sage Stallone, Tommy Morrison\n- Works: Rocky V\n- Roles: Union Cane, Tommy Gunn\n- Topics: Rocky film series, casting\n\nFacts:\n- In 1990, Mike Williams was most notable for portraying the fictional boxer Union Cane in the film Rocky V.\n- In 1990, Rocky V was released as the fifth film in the Rocky series.\n- Rocky V was written by Sylvester Stallone, who also starred in the film.\n- Rocky V co-starred Talia Shire and Sage Stallone, who was Sylvester Stallone's real-life son.\n- In Rocky V, real-life boxer Tommy Morrison played Tommy Gunn, a talented yet raw boxer.",
